* MCP1407  6 A non-inverting low-side MOSFET driver (Microchip)
* Behavioural model for ngspice built from the datasheet. NOT a vendor model.
* Source: docs/datasheets/MCP1407.pdf (DS20002019C), typical values at 25 C
* read at VDD = 5 V.
* See prototype1/README.md for how each parameter was derived.
*
* Pins: in vdd out gnd
.subckt MCP1407 in vdd out gnd
* Effective input capacitance (functional block diagram)
CIN  in gnd 25p
* Propagation delay: 70 ns at VDD = 5 V (Figure 2-6)
BDLY d1 0 V=V(in,gnd)
TDLY d1 0 d2 0 Z0=50 TD=70n
RDLY d2 0 50
* Output stage: thresholds 1.6 V rising / 1.3 V falling (Figure 2-11),
* 4.0 ohm pull-up and 2.7 ohm pull-down at VDD = 5 V (Figures 2-19, 2-20)
SHI  vdd out d2 0 MCP_HI
SLO  out gnd d2 0 MCP_LO
.model MCP_HI SW(vt=1.45 vh=0.15 ron=4.0 roff=1meg)
.model MCP_LO SW(vt=1.45 vh=0.15 ron=1meg roff=2.7)
* Quiescent supply current with logic-high input
IQ   vdd gnd 130u
.ends MCP1407
